'''Broken Shovel''' is a name shared by two separate items added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth †]].''

Together they form {{i|Mom's Shovel|n}}, which is used in [[The Forgotten#Unlocking The Forgotten|the process to unlock]] {{c|The Forgotten}}.

